From: t <tristan75015@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 01:58:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] views.md: accessors of the Fortran bindings refusing the
 layout

---
 docs/web/views.md | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/web/views.md b/docs/web/views.md
index a1898be..ac435f7 100644
--- a/docs/web/views.md
+++ b/docs/web/views.md
@@ -128,8 +128,9 @@ views of `mgis::function`.
 
 The layout is exposed by the `C`, `Fortran` and `Python` bindings. The
 `Python` bindings return `numpy` arrays with the strides of the layout.
-The two-dimensional accessors of the `Fortran` bindings refuse the
-`COMPONENT_BY_COMPONENT` layout.
+The accessors of the `Fortran` bindings returning multidimensional arrays
+(gradients, thermodynamic forces, internal state variables, tangent
+operator) refuse the `COMPONENT_BY_COMPONENT` layout.
 
 # Material data views
 
